          accept: __alloT('stem.weldlab.dh2_accept_porosity', 'AWS D1.1 visual criteria limit visible porosity by size and by total length per inch, and allow none in some joints (for example complete-penetration butt joints across the main tensile stress). Check the code edition and the contract.')
