          sectObs: __alloT('stem.weldlab.dh2_sobs_cleanband', 'Nothing shows in the section: the band is only the surface oxide removed.'),
          why: __alloT('stem.weldlab.dh2_why_cleanband', 'On aluminum, the electrode-positive half of the AC TIG cycle blasts the oxide skin off beside the weld, leaving a frosty band. It is normal. A missing band suggests too little cleaning action or dirty metal.')
